@startuml BuildFlow_Sequence_Diagram
title BuildFlow - Sequence Diagram (Design Review & Approval Workflow)
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Architect\n(Sophia)" as Arch <<primary_actor>>
boundary "Frontend UI\n(React)" as UI <<boundary>>
control "Backend API\n(Express)" as API <<control>>
database "Relational DB\n(SQLite/Prisma)" as DB <<entity>>
actor "Structural Engineer\n(Marcus PE)" as Eng <<primary_actor>>
actor "General Contractor\n(David)" as Cont <<primary_actor>>

== 1. Blueprint Upload & Submission ==
Arch -> UI: Uploads CAD drawing revision (v2.1 MEP)
UI -> API: POST /api/designs (code, version, uploaderId) {timeout = 5s}
API -> DB: INSERT INTO DesignDocument (status: UNDER_REVIEW)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO Notification (to: Marcus Brody)
API -> DB: INSERT INTO ActivityLog (action: UPLOADED_DESIGN)
API --> UI: 201 Created (Drawing record)
UI --> Arch: Display "Under Review" status badge

== 2. Engineering Calculation Review & Certification ==
Eng -> UI: Opens "Design Documents" & selects Drawing
UI -> API: GET /api/designs (filters by project)
API --> UI: Return Design details with version history

alt PE Load Calculation Verification [Passed]
  Eng -> UI: Clicks "Conduct Review", enters remarks & clicks "Approve"
  UI -> API: POST /api/designs/:id/review (decision: APPROVED, remarks)
  API -> DB: UPDATE DesignDocument SET status = 'APPROVED'
  API -> DB: INSERT INTO DesignReview (reviewerId, status, remarks)
  API -> DB: INSERT INTO Notification (to: Sophia & David)
  API -> DB: INSERT INTO ActivityLog (action: APPROVED_DESIGN)
  API --> UI: 200 OK (Updated status: APPROVED)
  UI --> Eng: Display Green Certified Badge
else Calculation Check [Failed]
  Eng -> UI: Clicks "Reject", enters Rework Orders
  UI -> API: POST /api/designs/:id/review (decision: REJECTED, remarks)
  API -> DB: UPDATE DesignDocument SET status = 'REJECTED'
  API --> UI: 200 OK (Status: REJECTED)
  UI --> Arch: Notify Architect to upload revision v2.2
end

== 3. Contractor Notification & Execution ==
API -> UI: Dispatches Notification
UI --> Cont: "Drawing approved - Proceed with L14-16 rough-in"
Cont -> UI: Moves Task TSK-104 from TODO to IN_PROGRESS
UI -> API: PATCH /api/tasks/TSK-104 (status: IN_PROGRESS)
API -> DB: UPDATE Task & recalculate Project Progress %
API --> UI: 200 OK (Project progress updated)
@enduml
